  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The task here is to add a method to OCFLObjectSession",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "CommitOption getCommitOption()",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This method will return the appropriate CommitOption based on a system property.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "With this feature in place,  the CommitOption param can be removed from PersistentStorageSession.commit().",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the future, the commit option will be configurable per OCFL object. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The default option will be UNVERSIONED.   The user will be able to change that value at runtime by setting the system property \"fcrepo.autoversioning.enabled\" to \"true\" ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
