  "description": "<p>The task here is to add a method to OCFLObjectSession<br/>\n CommitOption getCommitOption()</p>\n\n<p>This method will return the appropriate CommitOption based on a system property.</p>\n\n<p>With this feature in place,  the CommitOption param can be removed from PersistentStorageSession.commit().</p>\n\n<p>In the future, the commit option will be configurable per OCFL object. </p>\n\n<p>The default option will be UNVERSIONED.   The user will be able to change that value at runtime by setting the system property \"fcrepo.autoversioning.enabled\" to \"true\" </p>",
